<title>UK: Cargill confident IPE will resolve dispute promptl.</title>
<headline>Cargill confident IPE will resolve dispute promptl.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-11-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Trading house Cargill said on Thursday there were some problems in the first five-day delivery period on the November IPE gas oil but hoped to resolve these through IPE channels.</p>
<p>Cargill added in a statement it was confident the IPE would resolve any dispute in a prompt and just manner.</p>
<p>&quot;Cargill, in any futures contract on any futures exchange, takes all of its obligations extremely seriously,&quot; it said, adding it had kept the IPE fully informed &quot;through all the recent events with respect to this contract&quot;.</p>
</text>
